        // regenerating the whole file. Two formats:
        //   AURA_PROPOSE PATCH <oldtext> ||| <newtext>              (replace oldtext with newtext)
        //   AURA_PROPOSE PATCH FROM <anchorA> TO <anchorB> ||| <newtext>   (replace the whole span from
